{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "440cf54c52e71d037f50acd66701e232cf663407607cc59253017b05d9c7d15b", "ja": "始まりの英雄", "zh": "初始的英雄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "592dda6d41c2954d40861c9de13f63b77deb5abda7b8efa6124eb37a64fd4c55", "ja": "世界征服を企む集団『デストルドー』により\n世界は暗黒の時代を迎えていた。そんな中、\n突如現れたのは、悪に立ち向かう愛と正義の\nヒーロー『マイティセーラー』！\n正義と悪の長い戦いの始まりであった！", "zh": "世界正迎来由企图征服世界的组织“德斯特鲁多”带来的黑暗时代。在这时，突然出现了挺身对抗邪恶的爱与正义英雄“强力水手”！正义与邪恶的漫长战斗就此拉开序幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "cd5987015e5eb34d316e368e0439e5e6be30351f359dbfa15cddae1cb6602bf7", "ja": "暴力が暴力を呼ぶ暗黒の時代。人々は優しさを忘れ、\n欲望のままに互いを傷つけ、貪り合う……", "zh": "暴力滋生暴力的黑暗时代。人们忘却了温柔，\n任由欲望驱使，互相伤害，彼此掠夺……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "c7eb7f251e87f97326acb3bc02ca765d163299f7159afdbcfa0d506195ec379f", "ja": "そんな混沌を求める悪逆集団『デストルドー』により、\n世界は闇と暴力に覆われようとしていた……。", "zh": "这个渴求混沌的邪恶组织“Destrudo”，正要让世界被黑暗与暴力笼罩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1002_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "047c91a62e45138835657567c4e0835d956090f339929ca2fc42b1c54b4dc2e8", "ja": "いやーっ！　パパ！　パパーッ！", "zh": "不要啊！爸爸！爸爸——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1003_otousan", "source_sha256": "e93fb9de6710672eed23d0d4ce296ff5ac1d14943383cb09981f52d4b30ee17d", "ja": "ダメだ、こっちに来ちゃいけない！\nお前だけでも、早く逃げ……ぐっ、ぐわぁーっ！", "zh": "不行，不能到这边来！\n至少你快逃……呃、呜哇啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1004_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "7d0b11d475eb3cee0335a82784eceeaf14e382d275e215f2a4f13a7365d4f1c3", "ja": "ヒャハハハーッ！　どうだ！？　この無意味な暴力は！\n娘の目の前で、無様な姿をさらすがいい！", "zh": "呀哈哈哈——！怎么样！？这毫无意义的暴力！\n就在女儿面前，丢尽脸吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "f987a81cf37f0dc316a4eaf33d887b796fcbe176a48e6bce9d286d014fcad4ce", "ja": "だが……希望はまだ残されていた。\n暴力の嵐の中に輝く、小さくとも確かな灯火が！", "zh": "但是……希望仍未消失。\n那是在暴力的风暴中闪耀的、虽小却确实存在的灯火！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "2cdb3ffa6bb53ca2bcfeea48ad4a053e4b1fee60ebcb534cb5519b280a79845e", "ja": "待ちなさい、デストルドー！　えいっ！", "zh": "住手，德斯多鲁多！喝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1008_se", "source_sha256": "4a7384cf0f31bad47cbbbb52a7b3396893c58fcd42bc865920c5cae674a3ee81", "ja": "ドゴォッ！", "zh": "咚轰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1009_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "b40e681d8c4b9aaacff973d2b19b180e6666aea8950713c521ef362b1322fa23", "ja": "グハッ！？　わ、我らに暴力を振るうだと……！？\n何者だっ、貴様！", "zh": "咳！？你、你竟敢对我们动粗……！？\n你这家伙，到底是什么人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "da33599e0b2875dd28e199df22c808d089c0a3180ddc30cc4d85f61504482f44", "ja": "私は、あなた達デストルドーに立ち向かう者。\n……マイティセーラー！", "zh": "我是挺身对抗你们这些德斯特鲁多的人。\n……Mighty Sailor！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1011_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "e87d16c3f9620f8f8ff942ed8ab7a25623b5f7a89df49fcb026de7105d494c67", "ja": "何ッ！？　貴様が最近、我らに歯向かっているという\nあの、マイティセーラーか……！？", "zh": "什么！？你就是那个最近一直在和我们作对的……Mighty Sailor吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "9507bf163d5cd265c5218c409770b6746f98af7647df40475436e7f967aa2ffb", "ja": "デストルドー達は戦慄を覚えていた。それは、\nあずさの発するプレッシャーを恐れただけではなく……", "zh": "德斯特鲁多一伙感到了战栗。那不仅仅是因为害怕三浦梓散发出的压迫感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "22826739c0a2ab0dd98ab75ba03881f5de811e0a9dd07bc9cd3a586cb81c650a", "ja": "ついに自分達に対抗する者が現れたという、\n時代の転換そのものへの恐怖だった！", "zh": "终于出现了能够与自己等人抗衡的对手，这正是对时代变迁本身的恐惧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "28fe34342741a5a4104e001fa86b23ae89f85409951cb78dc3e80fd40cfcf1fc", "ja": "私の振るうこの力は、暴力ではないわ。\n愛を守り、正義を執行するための力……義力よ！", "zh": "我挥舞的这股力量，并不是暴力。是为了守护爱、执行正义的力量……义力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1015_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "c52c4e326956e9bf7a8e54ac1115c1f37d36ede166f297418a96042662a087e0", "ja": "ええい、こしゃくな！　目にもの見せてくれるわ！\nものども、かかれーっ！", "zh": "可恶，竟敢小看我！让你们见识见识我的厉害！\n诸位，给我上——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "45d4b6b46f1c2d3529f597da4780016857bd7b103fb22ce6f1dd7dea8bcabceb", "ja": "激しい戦いの中であずさの脳裏に蘇るのは、おのれに\n力を与えてくれた、高木博士との誓いであった！", "zh": "在激烈的战斗中，浮现在梓脑海里的，是与赋予她力量的高木博士立下的誓言！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1017_president", "source_sha256": "86fdad8267fd9b9c873b9fa5927625aa46d3d87a854180f4fb49a8b97a17ffa0", "ja": "あずさ君。私はね、後悔しているのだよ。", "zh": "阿梓啊。我啊，正后悔着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1018_president", "source_sha256": "0a8343c0a65bc21f5d2e706b2083a01217f78a39de103cdbd92f2c2d030ca1ef", "ja": "デストルドーに脅されていたとはいえ、\nデストル因子の研究を進めてしまったのは、この私だ。", "zh": "虽然曾受到Destru的威胁，\n但推进了Destru因子研究的人，正是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1019_president", "source_sha256": "36ec6a3439608d53b8bd35da87f758557ea2e065b789350f868112de3bf54306", "ja": "あれは人々を暴力へと駆り立てる、悪魔の因子だ！\n私は、取り返しがつかないことをしてしまった……。", "zh": "那是会将人们驱使向暴力的，恶魔的因子！\n我做了……无法挽回的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "5645c82f6789fe940167d9782dfa6a7c741d362faab9ce3371c3ee04295e1d56", "ja": "博士……お気持ちはわかります。でも振り返らないで。\n一緒に前を向いて、希望を探しましょう。", "zh": "博士……我理解您的心情。但是，请不要回头。\n让我们一起向前看，寻找希望吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "d05e0b8bfc7aedf17af0fa16c7adad7703e1265379500479616a81538df12e14", "ja": "そのために、私がいるんです。\n私が戦います。博士にもらったこの力で……。", "zh": "正因为如此，我才会在这里。\n我要战斗。用博士赐予我的这份力量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "e0be8b9171431ed5d288e48397aa751c34e8a0ce8882217337f3b07a196be604", "ja": "博士にもらった、この命で！", "zh": "用博士赋予的这条生命！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1023_president", "source_sha256": "71fc45e2ef63ed9761de48fce9c27dd6737916eba46b273533a8311c19530d5f", "ja": "あずさ君……ありがとう……。", "zh": "阿梓……谢谢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "89449b3530e8493f5b31d99f34368ca558d04d96ce62b8a02dd59a9ca48a17d4", "ja": "いいえ。これは私の……。\n私たちの誓いですもの。……ね、高木さん？", "zh": "不，这是我的……也是我们的誓言。……对吧，高木先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1025_president", "source_sha256": "328b5173b5bb976eb5bd796163666a215c70820a19486c924046eaf75df8141a", "ja": "うむ、そうだったな。私の研究と、君の中に眠る力、\nそして我々の意思が合わされば、怖いものなどない。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。只要将我的研究、沉睡在你体内的力量，\n以及我们的意志合而为一，便无所畏惧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1026_president", "source_sha256": "17ac3aa84001c04bd10ff179a29c4a6fee34717e7c48c2b05e0139c30950f023", "ja": "そのマイティセーラースーツには、私の全てを込めた。\n今こそ世界を覆う闇を振り払う時だ。", "zh": "我将自己的一切都倾注在那套Mighty Sailor战衣中。\n现在正是驱散笼罩世界的黑暗之时。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1027_president", "source_sha256": "f1603f38de271d6955ca6cd04686d4ea0a0684dba112ad7d0338dd131925dc40", "ja": "ゆけ、あずさ君！\nいや、マイティセーラー！", "zh": "去吧，梓！\n不，是英勇水手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "a23623bbf78f8e8a7c2a8a4994c1e125dcd1069b1c38e9ab48964d001e3e4f89", "ja": "はいっ！　はあぁぁ……\nキネティックパワー、オーバーブースト！", "zh": "好的！哈啊啊……\n动能之力，超限爆发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1029_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "0ddbfcff00ba08253c887c94b19752ea10b5b449aec344877817fe4016c8a130", "ja": "くらえーっ、デストルリンチ！\nデスデスデースッ！　デスデスデースッ！", "zh": "接招吧——Deathru的捆绑刑！\nDeath Death Death——！　Death Death Death——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "23c3430d9570cd949408743b0a00c460436face9f827eb0e96a54274549850ef", "ja": "……無駄よ。その程度のパワーで、\nマイティセーラーには傷一つつけられない。", "zh": "……没用的。凭那种程度的力量，\n连给强力水手留下一道伤痕都做不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1031_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "bda1a16a33ecf014d81953b013509e9ef4e87296b6f06c5d62cc308af3054771", "ja": "ば……バカな！　まるで効いていないだと！？", "zh": "不……不可能！竟然完全不起作用！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "2b44f0c7848dfe95f211aca94ede588dae4d03f9d12ac1cfc9688ba9be6d8355", "ja": "博士。貴方が目覚めさせてくれた、\n正義の力を使います！　はあぁぁっ！", "zh": "博士。我要使用您唤醒的正义之力！哈啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "3c6417aa32cafe275169fdb2e2ac52d7ed2790576277c33e5c43e94592def715", "ja": "キネティック・ラビリンス！", "zh": "动力迷宫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1034_se", "source_sha256": "b102a6f902000d7d3596e4daa602d163601216dcdba6f9588de3ec51675f764a", "ja": "ギュオオオオオォォォーッ！！！！", "zh": "咻——轰轰轰轰轰——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1035_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "1dff13d7a875c2d06edf00f8002cdf8926bb163026151440878946003c5df4f8", "ja": "うぎゃああああぁぁぁぁぁぁーっ！？", "zh": "呜呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "f81fb6b0af72b5f69d1d8b6cd651f0e21691307ca700ee19bbd319c7197aa418", "ja": "あずさから放たれた力の奔流が、デストルドー達を\n彼方へと吹き飛ばす！　それは、義力の嵐であった！", "zh": "由梓释放出的力量洪流，将Destrudo们吹飞到了远方！那是一场正义之力的风暴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "dfd42db55d225aaed5499de544166404f345684b1ea90bf23e34661b671059dd", "ja": "はぁ、はぁっ……、やったわ……！", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……成功了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1038_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "d3b171ccb5544ad37910717b5d2200676ecfd05374d4c02465520b268c198cd6", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、すごい……\nデストルドーをやっつけちゃった！", "zh": "姐姐，好厉害……竟然把德斯特鲁多打倒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1039_otousan", "source_sha256": "be7b2b28c45a3e64979e7547a44a2dcc5983d225cf25be679f826a041697f332", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "非常感谢！　非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1040_010azu", "source_sha256": "6bdb32ec0c2187641bfba5cadb9e4dadd118180c94670c099bd02ee58ae74a86", "ja": "無事でよかった。でもまだ、油断しないでくださいね。\nデストルドー達は、これからも現れるかもしれません。", "zh": "你没事就好。不过，还请不要掉以轻心。\n德斯特尔多可能还会继续出现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1041_se", "source_sha256": "8d672fc290e4f5bb608e77c9c513ae831b878bcdb2a9947dcc94a54988e63289", "ja": "ブーッ！　ブーッ！", "zh": "哔──！哔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1042_010azu", "source_sha256": "3b648ea55de1b4dcb69dc1b6652f53a13481b8f02e0b099bfdb9aeedd31cee88", "ja": "あっ、ちょっとごめんなさい。\nもしもし、博士？　どうしました？", "zh": "啊，不好意思，稍等一下。\n喂，是博士吗？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1043_president", "source_sha256": "8733889b8002d4aea250d7af91ce4e75eeaedbc3cbdf97b2b05f3dc7825c1402", "ja": "「あずさ君、西新宿に新たなデストルドーが現れた！\n連戦で申し訳ないが、現場へ急行してくれ！」", "zh": "“梓君，西新宿出现了新的德斯特鲁多！\n很抱歉让你连续作战，但请立刻赶往现场！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1044_010azu", "source_sha256": "28654c21334ed71bc00a901765f3938e7a4fa138650827628414c025dc965373", "ja": "わかりました。では、報告は後で……。\nいい、パパの言うことをよく聞いてね？　それじゃ。", "zh": "明白了。那么，报告之后再说……好好听爸爸的话，知道了吗？那就这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1045_010azu", "source_sha256": "dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4", "ja": "はっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "7f8b639473ce2a969280a471d7dbae8f75ebee7cea731731f64886528aa15f66", "ja": "こうして、のちに世界を希望の光で照らすことになる、\n始まりのヒーローは誕生したのだった！", "zh": "就这样，后来将用希望之光照亮世界的初始英雄诞生了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "a68d54bed6498033f5bbe0d144f2f45ec436635feb406e3689737da70c1c8ba0", "ja": "だが、世界を覆う闇は暗く、果てしない。\nたった一人で戦うあずさに、強敵たちが迫りくる！", "zh": "然而，笼罩世界的黑暗深邃无边。\n独自一人奋战的梓，正面临着强敌们的逼近！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_01_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "16d7ed3b1fcdfd0f0e8609b0f4368229ad952460d306e6a3f316c3397d9c4ad4", "ja": "次回『死の行進！　デストル怪獣軍団現る』！\n……えっ、怪獣の軍団！？　ズルくないですか！？", "zh": "下回《死亡行军！德斯特尔怪兽军团出现》！\n……诶，怪兽军团！？这不耍赖吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
